      "filePath": "tasks/03-fix-auth-response-mismatch.md",
      "summary": "Fixes login crash caused by $fetch type parameter wrapping mismatch. Auth store methods (login, register, fetchProfile, updateProfile) used $fetch<{ data: AuthResponse }> but server returns flat { accessToken, user } without data wrapper. All other stores (users, roles, permissions, guards, settings) were already correct. Single file change to stores/auth.ts, estimated 15 minutes.",
