      "name": "05-auth-fix",
      "filePath": "tasks/05-auth-fix.md",
      "summary": "End-to-end auth flow fix. Critical issue: all entity stores (guards, roles, permissions, users, settings) make $fetch calls WITHOUT Authorization header, causing 401 Unauthorized on all data tables. Also fixes guest middleware not redirecting/clearing store, redundant fetchProfile() on every page (moved to layout), and useMessage() SSR crash in Naive UI components. Recommends refactoring stores to use useApi composable for centralized token attachment.",
